"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Presence of psychotic symptoms\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"AND\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"with a SCID-R score higher than 2\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"and a diagnosis of psychotic depression by DSM-IV\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Intent or plan to attempt suicide in near future\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"or high suicide risk\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Presence of any Axis I psychiatric disorder\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"other than unipolar major depression\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or substance abuse\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or history of psychiatric disorders other than unipolar major depression or generalized anxiety disorder\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Dementia: Diagnosis of dementia by DSM-IV\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Mild Cognitive Impairment (MCI)\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Acute or severe medical illness\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"i.e., delirium, metastatic cancer, decompensated cardiac, liver or kidney failure, major surgery, stroke or myocardial infarction during the three months prior to entry\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"or use of drugs known to cause depression\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"OR\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"e.g., reserpine, alpha-methyl-dopa, steroids, sympathomimetics withdrawal\"\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"OR\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"Neurological brain disease and/or history of electroconvulsive therapy\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"History of any use of citalopram or escitalopram during the current episode\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or need for drugs that may interact with these agents\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"i.e. drug metabolized by the 2D6 P450 isoenzyme system\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"